## 2. Grammar – Ngữ pháp: Thì Hiện Tại Đơn

### 2.1 Khẳng định (Affirmative)

```
I / You / We / They + V (nguyên thể)
He / She / It      + V-s / V-es
```

| Chủ ngữ | Ví dụ |
|---|---|
| I | I **wake up** at 6 every morning. |
| She | She **goes** to the gym after work. |
| They | They **have** dinner at 7 p.m. |

> ⚠️ **Quy tắc thêm -s/-es cho ngôi thứ 3:**
> - Thông thường: + **s** → *work → work**s***, *eat → eat**s***
> - Tận cùng -s, -sh, -ch, -x, -o: + **es** → *go → go**es***, *watch → watch**es***
> - Tận cùng phụ âm + y: đổi y → **ies** → *study → stud**ies***, *carry → carr**ies***

---

### 2.2 Phủ định (Negative)

```
I / You / We / They + don't + V
He / She / It       + doesn't + V
```

- I **don't** eat breakfast at home.
- She **doesn't** wake up early on weekends.
- They **don't** go to the gym every day.

---

### 2.3 Câu hỏi (Questions)

```
Do   + I/you/we/they + V?
Does + he/she/it     + V?
```

- **Do** you drink coffee in the morning? → Yes, I do. / No, I don't.
- **Does** he exercise every day? → Yes, he does. / No, he doesn't.
- **What time do** you wake up? → I wake up at 6:30.
- **What do** you do after work? → I usually go for a walk.

