## 4. Key Conversations – Hội thoại giao tiếp

### Conversation A: Hỏi về buổi sáng

> **A:** What time do you usually get up?
> **B:** I get up at 6:30. What about you?
> **A:** I wake up at 7. Do you have breakfast every day?
> **B:** Yes, always. I have coffee and toast. I don't eat a big breakfast.
> **A:** Me neither. I usually just have a smoothie.

---

### Conversation B: Lịch trình đi làm

> **A:** Do you go to work by bus or by motorbike?
> **B:** I ride my motorbike. I leave home at 7:45.
> **A:** What time does work finish?
> **B:** It finishes at 5:30. Then I go to the gym on Tuesdays and Thursdays.
> **A:** Wow, that's a busy day!
> **B:** Yes, but I go to bed early — at around 10:30.

---

### Conversation C: Cuối tuần

> **A:** Do you do anything special on weekends?
> **B:** I usually sleep in! I don't wake up until 9.
> **A:** Ha! I get up early even on weekends. Old habit.
> **B:** Really? What do you do in the morning?
> **A:** I go for a run, then cook a big breakfast. It's my favourite time of the week!

